OL,3,GNEWSAHospital order for MP office
OL,4,Abuilding arsonist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court has handed a hospital order to
OL,7,Fan arsonist who caused massive damage
OL,8,Fto a building that houses charities,
OL,9,Fhealth services and an MP's
OL,10,Fconstituency office.
OL,12,FJosh Oliver, 29, had been living rough
OL,13,Fnear Vermont House in Washington, near
OL,14,FSunderland, when he set fire to a bin
OL,15,Fstore in September 2025.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
