OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHospital order for MP office
OL,4,Abuilding arsonist
OL,5,
OL,6,FOliver pleaded guilty to arson and
OL,7,Fburglary on the basis he was
OL,8,F"reckless", but denied the attack had
OL,9,F"anything to do with" the Washington
OL,10,Fand Gateshead South Labour MP Sharon
OL,11,FHodgson who has an office in the
OL,12,Fbuilding.
OL,14,FAt Newcastle Crown Court, Judge Sarah
OL,15,FMallett said Oliver should be subject
OL,16,Fto an interim hospital order ahead of
OL,17,Fhis sentencing on 10 December.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
